利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":141.88,"default_fair_val":141.88,"premium_pct":-26.9,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":10,"pe_forward":8.8,"pb_trailing":2,"pb_forward":1.8,"div_yield":5.18,"ps_ratio":2.5,"fcf_to_ev":11.26,"fcf_to_mcap":9.83,"liab_to_assets":20.7,"cash_to_assets":21.1,"current_ratio":2.18,"roe":20.2,"roa":14.5,"moat":{"ticker":"TROW","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"T. Rowe Price 擁有強大的品牌聲譽，在資產管理行業中被視為可靠且專業的機構。這種聲譽是多年來穩健業績和客戶信任的結果，使其能夠在一定程度上維持其收費結構，儘管行業整體面臨價格壓力。然而，與某些消費品牌相比，其品牌影響力在直接定價權上的體現相對有限，更多體現在客戶黏性和獲取新客戶的優勢上。","comment_en":"T. Rowe Price benefits from a strong brand reputation in asset management, recognized for reliability and expertise. This reputation, built over years of consistent performance and client trust, allows for some pricing power, though the industry generally faces fee compression. However, compared to consumer brands, its brand influence on direct pricing is less pronounced, translating more into client stickiness and acquisition advantages."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"資產管理行業的進入壁壘主要來自監管牌照和合規要求，而非技術專利。T. Rowe Price 擁有必要的監管許可和豐富的合規經驗，這構成了一定的進入門檻。但這類壁壘並非獨特的專利，競爭對手可以通過同樣的途徑獲得。因此，在專利或特許權方面，其護城河相對較弱，不構成核心競爭優勢。","comment_en":"Barriers to entry in asset management stem primarily from regulatory licenses and compliance, not technological patents. T. Rowe Price possesses the necessary licenses and extensive compliance experience, creating a moderate entry hurdle. However, these are not unique patents, and competitors can obtain them through similar means. Thus, its moat in patents or proprietary rights is relatively weak and does not represent a core competitive advantage."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"對於機構客戶而言，更換資產管理機構涉及複雜的盡職調查、合規審查和潛在的業績波動風險，這構成了較高的轉換成本。T. Rowe Price 的長期客戶關係和穩定的業績記錄有助於鎖定客戶。然而，對於部分追求短期回報或對現有經理人表現不滿意的客戶，轉換的可能性依然存在，因此轉換成本並非絕對。","comment_en":"For institutional clients, switching asset managers involves complex due diligence, compliance reviews, and potential performance disruption risks, creating significant switching costs. T. Rowe Price's long-standing client relationships and stable track record help retain clients. However, clients seeking short-term gains or dissatisfied with current managers may still consider switching, meaning these costs are not absolute barriers."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"資產管理行業的網絡效應相對不明顯。雖然龐大的資產規模可能帶來一定的規模效應和市場影響力，但並非典型的網絡效應，即用戶增加不會直接提升產品或服務價值的模式。T. Rowe Price 的客戶基礎龐大，但這更多是規模優勢的體現，而非網絡效應驅動的增長。","comment_en":"Network effects are relatively weak in the asset management industry. While a large asset base can confer scale advantages and market influence, it's not a typical network effect where user growth directly enhances product value. T. Rowe Price has a substantial client base, but this reflects scale rather than growth driven by network effects."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"作為一家大型資產管理公司，T. Rowe Price 受益於顯著的規模經濟。其龐大的資產管理規模（AUM）使其能夠分攤固定成本（如研發、技術基礎設施、合規），從而降低單位管理費用。這種成本優勢使其在與規模較小的競爭對手競爭時具有價格彈性，並能維持較高的利潤率。","comment_en":"As a large asset management firm, T. Rowe Price benefits from significant economies of scale. Its substantial Assets Under Management (AUM) allow for the spreading of fixed costs (R&D, technology, compliance), reducing per-unit management fees. This cost advantage provides pricing flexibility against smaller competitors and helps maintain healthy profit margins."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"T. Rowe Price 的業務遍及全球，但其核心競爭力並非依賴於特定的地理位置或獨特的實物資產。其價值在於人才、品牌和管理流程，這些可以在不同地點複製。雖然其全球佈局有助於分散風險和接觸不同市場，但並未形成基於地理的獨特壁壘。","comment_en":"T. Rowe Price operates globally, but its core competitive strength does not rely on specific geographic locations or unique physical assets. Its value lies in talent, brand, and management processes, which are replicable across locations. While its global presence aids diversification and market access, it doesn't create a unique geographical barrier."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"T. Rowe Price 在運營效率方面表現穩健，尤其體現在其持續的盈利能力和穩定的股東回報上。公司注重技術投資以優化運營流程，並通過嚴格的成本控制來維持較高的利潤率。其穩定的 ROE 和 ROA 表明其能夠有效地將資產轉化為利潤，這得益於其成熟的運營體系。","comment_en":"T. Rowe Price demonstrates solid operational efficiency, reflected in its consistent profitability and stable shareholder returns. The company invests in technology to optimize processes and maintains high profit margins through rigorous cost controls. Its steady ROE and ROA indicate an effective conversion of assets into profits, supported by a well-established operational framework."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"T. Rowe Price 的管理層在資本配置方面展現了卓越的能力。公司歷史上通過穩定的股息支付和股票回購，有效地將自由現金流回饋給股東。同時，它也審慎地進行再投資以支持業務增長和技術升級。其強勁的自由現金流和健康的資產負債表為其提供了靈活的資本配置空間。","comment_en":"T. Rowe Price's management exhibits strong capital allocation capabilities. Historically, the company has effectively returned free cash flow to shareholders through consistent dividends and share buybacks. It also prudently reinvests in the business to support growth and technological upgrades. Its robust free cash flow and healthy balance sheet provide significant flexibility in capital deployment."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"T. Rowe Price 在客戶保留方面表現出色，這得益於其穩定的投資業績、卓越的客戶服務和強大的品牌信任度。長期機構客戶關係是其收入的重要支柱。雖然市場競爭激烈，但其專注於長期價值的投資理念有助於培養忠誠客戶群，降低客戶流失率。","comment_en":"T. Rowe Price excels in customer retention, driven by its consistent investment performance, excellent client service, and strong brand trust. Long-term institutional client relationships form a significant revenue base. Despite intense market competition, its focus on long-term value investing fosters a loyal client base, reducing churn."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"T. Rowe Price 的業務模式具有相當的持久性。資產管理行業的本質是提供專業的投資管理服務，只要其能持續產生穩健的回報並適應市場變化，其商業模式就能長期維持。儘管面臨來自被動投資和低成本指數基金的挑戰，但其主動管理能力和機構客戶服務仍能提供持久的競爭力。","comment_en":"T. Rowe Price's business model possesses considerable durability. The core of asset management lies in providing professional investment services; as long as it consistently delivers solid returns and adapts to market changes, its model can endure. Despite challenges from passive investing and low-cost index funds, its active management capabilities and institutional client services offer lasting competitiveness."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"T. Rowe Price 的護城河主要體現在其強大的品牌聲譽、顯著的規模經濟以及穩健的運營效率上，這些共同構成了其在資產管理行業中的競爭優勢。雖然其業務模式具有相當的持久性，且客戶轉換成本相對較高，但其護城河並非無懈可擊。它更像是一個「收費橋」模式，依賴於其專業能力和規模來收取管理費用，而非擁有獨特的專利或強烈的網絡效應。未來，公司需要持續關注技術創新和客戶服務，以應對行業的變革和競爭壓力，維持其長期價值。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"T. Rowe Price's moat is primarily built on its strong brand reputation, significant economies of scale, and robust operational efficiency, creating a competitive advantage in asset management. While its business model exhibits durability and customer switching costs are relatively high, the moat isn't impregnable. It functions more like a 'toll bridge,' relying on expertise and scale to earn fees, rather than possessing unique patents or strong network effects. The company must continue focusing on innovation and client service to navigate industry shifts and competitive pressures, sustaining its long-term value.","evidenceHash":"bc4356484424a81cbe66d24dc44b1ea3535fb825cde69dc22a26eca87521d23d","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"382890675c720c8995ed18faef563e70ec87b05bc78faff7ee8b9c4986e7b423"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"382890675c720c8995ed18faef563e70ec87b05bc78faff7ee8b9c4986e7b423"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TROW.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TROW.png","website":"https://www.troweprice.com","ceo":"Robert W. Sharps","full_time_employees":"7544","description":"T. Rowe Price Group, Inc. operates as a publicly traded entity specializing in investment management. The firm extends its financial expertise to a diverse range of clients, including individual investors, institutional organizations, retirement benefit plans, and financial intermediaries. It is responsible for the establishment and ongoing management of both equity and fixed income mutual funds. The company's investment activities encompass public stock and bond markets worldwide. Employing a bottom-up methodology, the firm integrates both fundamental and quantitative analysis, leveraging insights from both internal research capabilities and external sources for its investment decisions. A core tenet of its investment philosophy is socially responsible investing, with a significant emphasis on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) factors. Furthermore, T. Rowe Price engages in late-stage venture capital transactions, typically committing between $3 million and $5 million per investment. Historically, the firm was known as T. Rowe Group, Inc. and T. Rowe Price Associates, Inc. Established in 1937, its global headquarters are situated in Baltimore, Maryland. The firm maintains a substantial international presence, with additional offices in Colorado Springs, Colorado; Owings Mills, Maryland; San Francisco, California; New York, New York; Philadelphia, Pennsylvania; Tampa, Florida; Toronto, Ontario; Hellerup, Denmark; Amsterdam, The Netherlands; Luxembourg, Grand Duchy of Luxembourg; Zurich, Switzerland; Dubai, United Arab Emirates; London, United Kingdom; Sydney, New South Wales; Hong Kong; Tokyo, Japan; Singapore; Frankfurt, Germany; Madrid, Spain; Milan, Italy; Stockholm, Sweden; Melbourne, Australia; and Amsterdam, Netherlands.","description_en":"T. Rowe Price Group, Inc. operates as a publicly traded entity specializing in investment management. The firm extends its financial expertise to a diverse range of clients, including individual investors, institutional organizations, retirement benefit plans, and financial intermediaries. It is responsible for the establishment and ongoing management of both equity and fixed income mutual funds. The company's investment activities encompass public stock and bond markets worldwide. Employing a bottom-up methodology, the firm integrates both fundamental and quantitative analysis, leveraging insights from both internal research capabilities and external sources for its investment decisions. A core tenet of its investment philosophy is socially responsible investing, with a significant emphasis on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) factors. Furthermore, T. Rowe Price engages in late-stage venture capital transactions, typically committing between $3 million and $5 million per investment. Historically, the firm was known as T. Rowe Group, Inc. and T. Rowe Price Associates, Inc. Established in 1937, its global headquarters are situated in Baltimore, Maryland. The firm maintains a substantial international presence, with additional offices in Colorado Springs, Colorado; Owings Mills, Maryland; San Francisco, California; New York, New York; Philadelphia, Pennsylvania; Tampa, Florida; Toronto, Ontario; Hellerup, Denmark; Amsterdam, The Netherlands; Luxembourg, Grand Duchy of Luxembourg; Zurich, Switzerland; Dubai, United Arab Emirates; London, United Kingdom; Sydney, New South Wales; Hong Kong; Tokyo, Japan; Singapore; Frankfurt, Germany; Madrid, Spain; Milan, Italy; Stockholm, Sweden; Melbourne, Australia; and Amsterdam, Netherlands.","description_zh":"**T. Rowe Price Group, Inc. (TROW) 業務營運分析**\n\nT. Rowe Price Group, Inc. 是一家公開上市的專業投資管理公司，為個人投資者、機構法人、退休金計畫及金融中介機構等多元客戶提供服務。其核心業務聚焦於股票型及固定收益型共同基金的設立與持續管理。公司投資範圍涵蓋全球公開股票與債券市場。\n\nT. Rowe Price 採用由下而上的投資方法，結合基本面與量化分析，並整合內部研究能力與外部資訊來源，以制定投資決策。其投資哲學強調社會責任投資，特別關注環境、社會及公司治理 (ESG) 因子。此外，公司亦參與晚期階段的創投交易，單筆投資金額通常介於 300 萬至 500 萬美元。\n\n該公司成立於 1937 年，總部位於馬里蘭州巴爾的摩，並在全球設有多個辦事處，展現其國際化的營運規模。","address":"1307 Point Street","city":"Baltimore","state":"MD","zip":"21231","country":"US","phone":"410 345 2000","full_address":"1307 Point Street, Baltimore, MD 21231, US","range_52w":"85.22-122","year_high":122,"year_low":85.22,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":85.22,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"WIJNBERG SANDRA S","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":163,"price":104.51,"total_val":0.02},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"WILSON ALAN D","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":520,"price":104.51,"total_val":0.05},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"Verma Richard R.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":60,"price":104.51,"total_val":0.01},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"STEVENS ROBERT J","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":314,"price":104.51,"total_val":0.03},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"Smith Cynthia F","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":77,"price":104.51,"total_val":0.01},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"Golston Allan C.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":60,"price":104.51,"total_val":0.01},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"MacLellan Robert F.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":212,"price":104.51,"total_val":0.02},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"DUBLON DINA","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":120,"price":104.51,"total_val":0.01},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"DONNELLY WILLIAM P","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":163,"price":104.51,"total_val":0.02},{"date":"2026-08-26","name":"Nelson Joshua B","title":"officer: Vice 